cff-version: 1.2.0
# a doi field is added later, once a release has been archived (CHANGELOG.md).
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
message: "If you use KELP in your work, please cite the article given under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "KELP: Kinematic Engine for Lagrangian Particles"
authors:
  - family-names: Kuznetsov
    given-names: Ivan
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/CliDyn/kelp"
url: "https://github.com/CliDyn/kelp"
abstract: >-
  A Lagrangian particle tracker for unstructured ocean model meshes (FESOM2,
  FESOM 1.4, FESOM-C) and HEALPix grids: 2-D and 3-D advection with Euler,
  RK2, RK4 and adaptive RK45 integrators, temporal velocity reconstruction,
  rotated-frame tracking, stochastic diffusion, beaching, field sampling
  along trajectories, and streaming NetCDF/Zarr output with restarts.
keywords:
  - Lagrangian particle tracking
  - ocean modelling
  - unstructured mesh
  - FESOM
  - HEALPix
  - Python
  - Numba
